money to any Republican.

00:36:04.662 --> 00:36:07.932 line:0%
And so it's this
reactionary thing.

00:36:07.932 --> 00:36:09.867 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
You know, some of
those same companies

00:36:09.867 --> 00:36:13.404 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
refused to shut down their
operations in Russia.

00:36:13.404 --> 00:36:17.074 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
I think it's okay that
companies are always gonna act

00:36:17.074 --> 00:36:19.277 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
in their own
financial interests.

00:36:19.277 --> 00:36:22.914 line:0%
We understand that they wanna
sell, they wanna make money.

00:36:24.081 --> 00:36:26.417 line:0%
The public has a big
role to play here.

00:36:26.417 --> 00:36:30.354 line:0%
You know, how do we get
people to put pressure

00:36:30.354 --> 00:36:33.925 line:0%
so that human rights and
values become part of it.

00:36:33.925 --> 00:36:35.893 line:0%
And I'm not a purist, you know,

00:36:35.893 --> 00:36:38.129 line:0%
I will go shop at places

00:36:38.129 --> 00:36:41.899 line:0%
where they give most of
their money to Democrats.

00:36:41.899 --> 00:36:44.435 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
I'm not gonna be
one of those people,

00:36:44.435 --> 00:36:47.205 line:0%
but there are moments where I
think you gotta take a stand.

00:36:47.205 --> 00:36:51.542 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
I'm not a big
believer in you know,

00:36:51.542 --> 00:36:53.744 line:0%
saying that we're gonna
boycott certain things,

00:36:53.744 --> 00:36:57.215 line:0%
but I think that you
can use your own power

00:36:57.215 --> 00:36:58.916 line:0%
of your money.

00:36:58.916 --> 00:37:01.819 line:0%
You have the choice.

00:37:01.819 --> 00:37:06.791 line:0%
Right now, I think with
what Russia is doing,

00:37:06.791 --> 00:37:09.727 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
we should apply
financial pressure,

00:37:09.727 --> 00:37:11.395 line:0%
personal financial pressure,

00:37:11.395 --> 00:37:14.365 align:start size:88% position:13% line:0%
and Swyft and companies
should recognize

00:37:14.365 --> 00:37:18.302 line:0%
that this is a belligerent
moment from this country.

00:37:18.302 --> 00:37:21.639 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
But I also think
that 69 countries
criminalize homosexuality

00:37:21.639 --> 00:37:24.642 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
and some of these same
people who moralize

00:37:24.642 --> 00:37:27.111 line:0%
about oh, I can't do
business with Russia.

00:37:27.111 --> 00:37:28.746 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
They're doing business
with countries

00:37:28.746 --> 00:37:31.082 line:0%
that will put a gay
person in prison

00:37:31.082 --> 00:37:32.817 line:0%
simply because they're gay.

00:37:32.817 --> 00:37:34.885 line:0%
And so where does
that line stop?

00:37:35.820 --> 00:37:37.588 line:0%
I'll also say you know,

00:37:37.588 --> 00:37:40.625 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
I've gotten hit from a
foreign policy establishment

00:37:40.625 --> 00:37:44.061 line:0%
because I said that I
won't sign any letter

00:37:44.061 --> 00:37:47.064 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
that says we should
have a no fly,

00:37:47.064 --> 00:37:48.933 line:0%
you know, implement
a no-fly zone now,

00:37:48.933 --> 00:37:51.302 line:0%
even a humanitarian no-fly zone.

00:37:51.302 --> 00:37:55.172 line:0%
The idea that there's
a light no-fly zone

00:37:55.172 --> 00:37:58.142 line:0%
or partial no-fly
zone is ridiculous.

00:37:58.142 --> 00:38:01.178 line:0%
A no-fly zone is meaning

00:38:01.178 --> 00:38:02.513 line:0%
you're gonna shoot
down a Russian plane.

00:38:02.513 --> 00:38:03.814 line:0%
- You gotta something, yeah.

00:38:03.814 --> 00:38:05.149 line:0%
- Yeah.

00:38:05.149 --> 00:38:06.417 line:0%
And I'm all against that.

00:38:06.417 --> 00:38:09.086 line:0%
I do think though, that
the line in the sand is

00:38:09.086 --> 00:38:10.955 line:0%
a NATO ally.

00:38:10.955 --> 00:38:12.390 line:0%
We have a treaty obligation,

00:38:12.390 --> 00:38:15.226 line:0%
an article five wire is tripped

00:38:15.226 --> 00:38:18.496 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
if there's an attack in
Poland or on a NATO country.

00:38:18.496 --> 00:38:20.898 line:0%
That's a different story
because we got to have,

00:38:20.898 --> 00:38:22.233 line:0%
we gotta have set boundaries

00:38:22.233 --> 00:38:24.168 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
and we've gotta
enforce boundaries.

00:38:24.168 --> 00:38:27.471 align:start position:0% line:0%
What you see going on in
Ukraine is heartbreaking though.

00:38:27.471 --> 00:38:29.440 line:0%
It's terrible, I mean, to watch,

00:38:29.440 --> 00:38:31.976 line:0%
but all of the media
are focusing on that.

00:38:31.976 --> 00:38:33.477 line:0%
And I continue to believe

00:38:34.612 --> 00:38:36.380 line:0%
that if the media all
moved to the Congo

00:38:36.380 --> 00:38:37.882 line:0%
and start telling us the stories

00:38:37.882 --> 00:38:39.116 line:0%
of what's going on in the Congo,

00:38:39.116 --> 00:38:41.919 line:0%
there'd be calls from
NATOcons and others

00:38:41.919 --> 00:38:43.220 align:start size:81% position:19% line:0%
to have a NoFL
zone in the Congo,

00:38:43.220 --> 00:38:44.889 line:0%
and then they'd move
to another country.

00:38:44.889 --> 00:38:48.392 line:0%
And it would just be
this perpetual problem.

00:38:48.392 --> 00:38:50.461 line:0%
What we need to do as Americans

00:38:50.461 --> 00:38:53.798 line:0%
is recognize that the
criteria that we have

00:38:53.798 --> 00:38:57.868 line:0%
is what makes America less safe.

00:38:57.868 --> 00:39:00.838 line:0%
We have to respond to the
national security threats

00:39:00.838 --> 00:39:02.106 line:0%
for America.

00:39:02.106 --> 00:39:04.809 line:0%
Never apologize about
putting America first

00:39:04.809 --> 00:39:09.146 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
because we are largely
a moral country.

00:39:09.146 --> 00:39:10.748 align:start size:81% position:19% line:0%
I don't think that
we're perfect.

00:39:10.748 --> 00:39:12.650 line:0%
And I'm not saying that,

00:39:12.650 --> 00:39:15.319 line:0%
but I am saying that we
have the best system,

00:39:15.319 --> 00:39:16.754 line:0%
a checks and a balance.

00:39:16.754 --> 00:39:20.458 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
I mean, every month are stats
going out on our economy

00:39:20.458 --> 00:39:22.593 line:0%
and there's a whole industry

00:39:22.593 --> 00:39:24.795 line:0%
that will immediately say

00:39:24.795 --> 00:39:25.863 line:0%
yeah, that number is high

00:39:25.863 --> 00:39:27.198 line:0%
or that number should be lower.

00:39:27.198 --> 00:39:29.033 line:0%
You didn't include this.

00:39:29.033 --> 00:39:31.936 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
We have transparency
in our country.

00:39:31.936 --> 00:39:33.938 line:0%
We should be really
proud of the system

00:39:33.938 --> 00:39:36.474 line:0%
because our system is the best.

00:39:36.474 --> 00:39:38.175 line:0%
While not perfect,

00:39:38.175 --> 00:39:40.878 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
we should never apologize
for this system.

00:39:40.878 --> 00:39:43.781 line:0%
And I think that's
where we have failed,

00:39:43.781 --> 00:39:45.449 align:start size:88% position:13% line:0%
is we've allowed people
to really tear down

00:39:45.449 --> 00:39:48.386 line:0%
the greatest system and say
it's not the greatest system.

00:39:49.553 --> 00:39:51.288 line:0%
- Rick, you just gave
a beautiful ending,

00:39:51.288 --> 00:39:53.457 line:0%
but I will ask you
one other question,

00:39:53.457 --> 00:39:57.495 line:0%
which is that as a gay,

00:39:57.495 --> 00:39:58.596 line:0%
as they say,

00:39:58.596 --> 00:40:00.297 line:0%
will you come to Florida?

00:40:00.297 --> 00:40:03.067 line:0%
You can bring Matt and
David and the four of us,

00:40:03.067 --> 00:40:05.035 line:0%
we will go out to dinner

00:40:05.035 --> 00:40:06.771 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
and we will say gay in front
of people here in Florida

00:40:06.771 --> 00:40:08.005 line:0%
and see what happens.

00:40:08.005 --> 00:40:09.407 line:0%
Are you willing
to take the risk?

00:40:09.407 --> 00:40:10.307 line:0%
- Let's do it.

00:40:10.307 --> 00:40:11.342 line:0%
We'll be there.

00:40:12.410 --> 00:40:13.411 line:0%
- Good seeing you, my friend.

00:40:13.411 --> 00:40:14.445 line:0%
Thanks for joining.

00:40:14.445 --> 00:40:15.279 line:0%
- All he best.

00:40:15.279 --> 00:40:16.814 line:0%
Thanks, Dave.

